{"product":{"id":8048123609166,"title":"JPG Essentials Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three iconic Jean Paul Gaultier creations — a tropical woody scent, an elegant vanilla-amber fragrance, and the timeless fresh-aromatic Le Male. Three miniatures that showcase the unmistakable character of JPG before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLe Beau Le Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is pineapple, iris, ginger, and cypress over coconut and woody notes, settling into tonka bean, sandalwood, amber, and ambergris — tropical, creamy, and seductive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLe Male Le Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is cardamom over lavender and iris, settling into a rich vanilla base — warm, elegant, and irresistibly smooth.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLe Male Eau de Toilette\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is fresh mint over comforting lavender, settling into sensual vanilla — clean, classic, and effortlessly masculine.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree JPG essentials, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover your next signature fragrance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-02T15:36:52+05:30","handle":"jpg-essentials-for-men-sample-set-le-beau-le-parfum-le-male-le-parfum-le-male-edt-3-1-5ml","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:55:24+05:30","publi